---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
export const prerender = true;
---
<BaseLayout title="About">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>Wexmoor is a 40-person company in Canada, led by two founders. Its teams cover platform engineering, data engineering, solutions, customer success, sales, finance and operations, people operations, and product and design. Its first customers are retail and logistics companies.</p>
  <p>Wexmoor is fictional. Its staff, customers, and data are invented, so that a security analyst can practise protecting a realistic business in the open. The IT support and security role is played by Goya.</p>
</BaseLayout>
